    Bug 2022456 - Port bug 1937541 - Migrate collation to ICU4X. r=mkmelin

    I think it's easiest to just stop using collation sort keys (which Collator no longer has
    functions for) and just compare string values. I've continued to use the term "key" despite
    the change in what it actually does.

